  "card": "Bitcoin Core derives the default Tor onion bind port by adding 1 to -port. Setting -port=65535 causes this calculation to wrap to 0, unexpectedly binding the node's onion service to a random ephemeral port. This change fails initialization early with an error when -port=65535 and an onion port must be derived, while keeping explicit onion port bindings valid.",
